ultaneously set the second input to \\\"Alice Smith\\\" — they share one value and cannot be filled independently. React duplicate-key console errors were also emitted.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"resu\\\" (>2 chars) rendered a real-time suggestion dropdown containing a \\\"Professional Resume\\\" button; clicking it set the search box to \\\"Professional Resume\\\" and narrowed results to \\\"Showing 1 of 6\\\" with only that card.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All controls updated results and the \\\"Showing X of 6\\\" count in-place at URL http://localhost:6089/ with no navigation: search (\\\"re\\\"→5, \\\"professional\\\"→1), category (Resume→1), scenario (Academic→1), favorites-only toggle (→2), and all four sort orders re-ordered the grid live.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With empty form, banner reads \\\"Required fields missing — Please fill in: Full Name, Job Title, Email, Professional Summary, Company Name, Position, Start Date, Responsibilities, Degree, School, Graduation Year, Skills\\\" and the \\\"Preview Result\\\" tab is [disabled].\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-24\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On favoriting, heart svg class changed to \\\"lucide-heart w-4 h-4 fill-current\\\" with computed fill rgb(242,147,13) and header badge incremented 0→1→2 instantly. Unfavoriting reverted the icon, decremented badge to 1, and removed the card from the favorites list — all without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Plain-text template \\\"QA Plain Note\\\" previews inside <pre class=\\\"whitespace-pre-wrap\\\"> preserving the 4-space indent and line breaks, with {{name}} substituted to \\\"Alice Smith\\\". Markdown templates (built-in Resume, custom \\\"QA Daily Standup\\\") render as real h1/h2/h3, strong, em and hr elements after substitution.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-26\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Immediately after submit (no reload, URL unchanged), the sidebar count went \\\"Showing 6 of 6\\\" → \\\"Showing 7 of 7\\\" and a new card \\\"QA Daily Standup / QA Bot / 0 uses / Updated 2026-08-27\\\" appeared in the grid.\"}]}"
